{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Anthropic宣佈今日啓動A類普通股首次公開發行（IPO）路演，預計將於下周三定價，並於周四開始交易，IPO目標估值約1萬億美元。發行價區間預計為每股70–78美元。公司已申請在納斯達克全球精選市場上市，股票代碼ANT。</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.782973+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:29:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.716216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:40.929596+00:00","content_hash":"71ddfef9de247ebda69b93b8ab59def185143851811be6b7abc13093c3d99171","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.782973+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}